
@startuml
title Current Workflow

start

:User Request;

fork
    :ProductOwner;
    note right
        - Refine requirements
        - Create/update stories
        - Prioritize backlog
    end note
fork again
    :ScrumMaster;
    note left
        - Facilitate events
        - Remove impediments
        - Monitor budget
        - Calculate KPIs
        - Author sprint report
    end note
fork again
    :DevTeam;
    note left
        - Implement stories
        - Create pull requests
        - Run tests
    end note
fork again
    :QA;
    note right
        - Review pull requests
        - Propose test cases
    end note
fork again
    :Architect;
    note right
        - Review pull requests
        - Propose ADRs
    end note
end fork

:Sprint Review;
note right
    - Demonstrate increment
    - Gather feedback
end note

:Sprint Retrospective;
note left
    - Discuss what went well
    - Discuss what could be improved
end note

stop

@enduml
